  "name": "Kaervek's Blight",
  "description": "Mono-black Brawl. Kaervek, the Spiteful shrinks every other creature on the board by -1/-1, so the deck is built entirely out of bodies that survive it \u2014 Hooded Blightfang, Carrion Grub, Crypt Lurker and Massacre Wurm \u2014 while the opponent's one-toughness creatures simply fall off. Grasp of Darkness and Pestilent Haze finish what Kaervek starts, Underworld Dreams and Hypnotic Specter tax the refill, and Short Sword hands one attacker its point back. (Black)",
